aa", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "completed", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/fr/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:48.439Z", "snapshotHash": "96153ba83a0d54cdb3cb190bfd5490a4d4feeb70b23ce4ef8543d9fde0ec37b9", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "under_construction", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/fr/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:48.439Z", "snapshotHash": "96153ba83a0d54cdb3cb190bfd5490a4d4feeb70b23ce4ef8543d9fde0ec37b9", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "completed", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/es/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:53.278Z", "snapshotHash": "237d15fc0d4b5081280aed3770c446c1262cd3d7c88ebe8d5a1160b1ecd9017a", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "under_construction", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/es/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:53.278Z", "snapshotHash": "237d15fc0d4b5081280aed3770c446c1262cd3d7c88ebe8d5a1160b1ecd9017a", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "completed", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/tr/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:58.357Z", "snapshotHash": "1ed59c6337643f71494b6ad9ba55945edd2d75e984ca237ff36b76912cffc60b", "tier": 4}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-007', 'high', 'branding', 'hotel.brandAffiliation', 'Cebeci İnşaat signed a Wyndham licence for the hotel component (Turizm Güncel). Agoda and OnTheBeach both list the property as ''Azura World Hotel (ex. Wyndham Alanya)'', and Tripadvisor renamed the same property id in place. The Wyndham branding was dropped between opening and 2026.', 'name = ''Azura World Hotel'', formerName = ''Wyndham Alanya'', brandAffiliation = null with a note. The ticket''s wyndham.antalyacoast.com link points at the superseded brand and is kept as a historical source, never as current identity.', 'null'::jsonb, '[{"value": "Wyndham Hotels & Resorts", "source": {"url": "https://www.turizmguncel.com/haber/ahmet-cebeci-wyndham-markasini-alanyaya-getiriyor", "publisher": "Turizm Güncel", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:48:56.060Z", "snapshotHash": "e5aaffeab5baaf63be7643eb01cdb0f1f948103c89b1e199f1a8745ccc1e2343", "tier": 6}}, {"value": "Azura World Hotel", "source": {"url": "https://azuraworldhotel.com/en", "publisher": "Azura World Hotel", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:46:54.389Z", "snapshotHash": "72d182be2fb412a648fba5085d267c84d43f4fc0e2c960b0802aa21942812040", "tier": 3}}, {"value": "Azura World Hotel", "source": {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/azuraworldhotel/", "publisher": "Instagram — Azura World Hotel", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:48:19.478Z", "snapshotHash": "1a5df7ea970e0beb9be7b4770e95308df1c0209baef002c5b1cbc3eaf725b8ca", "tier": 3}}, {"value": "Azura World Hotel", "source": {"url": "https://www.onthebeach.co.uk/hotels/turkey/antalya/alanya/azura-world-hotel", "publisher": "OnTheBeach", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:48:42.838Z", "snapshotHash": "872758584168433e094df807e0579c215f120b9c7b45f7f7b391d2a6ad694bc0", "tier": 5}}, {"value": "Azura World Hotel", "source": {"url": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1069655-d33144231-Reviews-Azura_World_Hotel-Turkler_Alanya_Turkish_Mediterranean_Coast.html", "publisher": "Tripadvisor", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:49.207Z", "snapshotHash": "b0a8ff3e5ef1a37c2031f8c12dda59b9c001b2e4054e1e3090eed73f52803bc1", "tier": 5}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-008', 'medium', 'structure', 'project.greenAreaSqm', 'Green area: 20,000 m² (Alanya-Home, Housearch) vs ''over 41,000 m² of landscaped green areas'' (ENS Pride). Alanya-Home''s own breakdown closes arithmetically — green 20,000 + footprint 15,000 + outdoor 41,000 = 76,000 m², exactly the plot area three other hosts state independently.', 'greenAreaSqm = 20,000. ENS Pride conflated the outdoor-facility figure with green space; the arithmetic identity is what settles it, not a preference between publishers. ENS Pride''s 41,000 stays in conflictsWith.', '20000'::jsonb, '[{"value": 20000, "source": {"url": "https://alanya-home.com/property/466/de/verkauf_wohnungen_in_azura_world_residence_hotel_turkler_alanya_turkei", "publisher": "Alanya-Home", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:11.080Z", "snapshotHash": "f350808388a3535e5c3334554dfd2c905c086b44da89bb74f15c675873f8777c", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 20000, "source": {"url": "https://alanya-home.com/property/891/en/azura_world_residence_hotel", "publisher": "Alanya-Home", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:16.229Z", "snapshotHash": "cfb8c83d3685b8dfd4649fa735139451a22b46083c8473cbc9421509b255b07b", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 41000, "source": {"url": "https://enspride.com/property/azura-world-residence-hotel-a-new-iconic-lifestyle-concept-in-alanya/", "publisher": "ENS Pride", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:48:12.142Z", "snapshotHash": "36e5a6844ac2ff181c400a3898b677f7985474167a43ac82c2885c2cff4fce0c", "tier": 6}}, {"value": 20000, "source": {"url": "https://www.seaside-alanya.com/de/antalya-alanya/residence/azura-world-residence", "publisher": "Seaside Alanya", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:31.915Z", "snapshotHash": "3d74064c8eb4e79bb1bcfbf5c5647aa8b1b49818f41820c6bf14ac3fff03a7f6", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 20000, "source": {"url": "https://www.seaside-alanya.com/en/property/-azura-world-residence-hotel-apartments-for-sale-new-project", "publisher": "Seaside Alanya", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:36.436Z", "snapshotHash": "dc63100403cd03693b16636b9cf2531d08e91f7a26c0514f9095cb7ed71358c1", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 20000, "source": {"url": "https://terrarealestate.com/project/azura-world-residence-and-villas", "publisher": "TERRA Real Estate", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:46:59.591Z", "snapshotHash": "4302823ac1dc53672a5545b6a10740b592ceddd0cc08e2778c9c2ed37ba7021c", "tier": 4}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-009', 'medium', 'structure', 'project.developerFoundedYear', 'Developer experience: ''more than 30 years'' (Seaside), ''40 years'' (azuraworld.com, Alanya-Home), established 1982 (Housearch).', 'developerFoundedYear = 1982. 1982 to the 2022 construction start is 40 years, which reconciles the ''40 years'' copy; Seaside''s ''30 years'' is older or rounded down. The year is the fact; the ''40 years'' phrasing is marketing.', '1982'::jsonb, '[{"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://www.cebecigroup.com/en/projects", "publisher": "Cebeci Group", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:18.081Z", "snapshotHash": "21b88be518266cdd79724b0424a30982000445ea4d694a38cc5f9a28fc61c08f", "tier": 2}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/de/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:21.849Z", "snapshotHash": "643c8293224695449ccbdd26f25bb41fb8d4fe7154f61e37cabcbd765e01bb1e", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:27.237Z", "snapshotHash": "9d5cd8fe3a54d7795332f47e2e9dde8eb20205b7a50375d4b6ca8046c3865d08", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/ru/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:39.282Z", "snapshotHash": "d6bb22db97ffebff05ee76debdae703f6e0e03013ca45fa82c93d8572e2d6cd8", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/de/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:43.796Z", "snapshotHash": "8e93a3f9274d55fdfadbc42e66b4eaa2216b3fc1553d7a209ed211227affe2aa", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/fr/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:48.439Z", "snapshotHash": "96153ba83a0d54cdb3cb190bfd5490a4d4feeb70b23ce4ef8543d9fde0ec37b9", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/es/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:53.278Z", "snapshotHash": "237d15fc0d4b5081280aed3770c446c1262cd3d7c88ebe8d5a1160b1ecd9017a", "tier": 4}}, {"value": 1982, "source": {"url": "https://www.instagram.com/cebeci.group/", "publisher": "Instagram — Cebeci Group", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:48:35.961Z", "snapshotHash": "61bf23e7d17a471ba8789ff6de6f2922b87adb1f4a111c3fcd23e8a2c511f80b", "tier": 2}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-010', 'medium', 'harvest', 'harvest.authority', 'Source authority measured at harvest: 45/60 sources returned validated content. Tier <=3 (official / developer / hotel) sources validated: 5 — azuraworld-official, azuraworldhotel, cebecigroup-index, instagram-azuraworldhotel, instagram-cebecigroup.', 'Tier <=3 corroboration now exists for the fields those sources actually state. Structural figures they do NOT state still rest on tier 4-6 and are labelled single_source or conflicted accordingly.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-011', 'high', 'structure', 'units[].id', 'No source publishes a unit-by-unit inventory. 656 total units is corroborated (Seaside, ENS Pride) but the per-block and per-floor breakdown is not stated anywhere. 25 units are backed by real portal listings; 631 are synthesised to fill the confirmed total.', 'Synthesised units carry dataQuality ''modelled'' and an askingPrice confidence of ''inferred'' (or ''gap'' where no basis exists), with the derivation named in the note. Block/sequence ids are internal addressing keys and are not developer unit numbers — including for the real listings, whose position in the project no portal states. A modelled unit must never render as a real listing.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-012', 'medium', 'harvest', 'harvest.azuraworldhotel', 'azuraworldhotel.com (tier 3, the hotel''s own site) was recorded as ''TLS invalid'' on the shallow pass. Under Chromium it validated WITHOUT any tolerance flag. The server sends an incomplete certificate chain; browsers repair that by fetching the missing intermediate (AIA), Node''s strict TLS stack does not. The fetch failure was real; the diagnosis ''invalid certificate'' was wrong.', 'Content is trusted at its normal tier because no verification was waived to obtain it. The server chain is still misconfigured and any non-browser client integrating with them will fail — worth telling the client.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-013', 'high', 'pricing', 'units[].askingPrice', 'Alanya-Home publishes the SAME project twice, as property 466 and property 891, with different entry prices and different size ranges (466: from EUR 220,000, from 85 m²; 891: from EUR 125,000, 80-300 m²). One publisher contradicting itself on its own site is a stronger signal about price reliability than two publishers disagreeing, because portal-to-portal variation has innocent explanations that this does not.', 'Both pages are kept as separate sources and both prices enter the F-002 range. Neither is treated as the correction of the other — no evidence says which is current, and picking the lower would flatter the project while picking the higher would flatter the comparison.', 'null'::jsonb, '[{"value": 30, "source": {"url": "https://alanya-home.com/property/466/de/verkauf_wohnungen_in_azura_world_residence_hotel_turkler_alanya_turkei", "publisher": "Alanya-Home", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:11.080Z", "snapshotHash": "f350808388a3535e5c3334554dfd2c905c086b44da89bb74f15c675873f8777c", "tier": 4}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-014', 'high', 'harvest', 'harvest.booking', 'The ticket''s Booking.com URL (/hotel/tr/azura-world.html) is a DIFFERENT property — a private apartment near Alanya centre, roughly 15 km from Türkler — not the 5-star hotel. The hotel kept its pre-rebrand slug, /hotel/tr/wyndham-alanya.html, which is itself further evidence for F-007. Had this gone unchecked, another property''s rating and review count would have been published as Azura World''s, correctly cited to a URL that genuinely resolves — the hardest kind of error to spot downstream.', 'The corrected URL is the source of record; the ticket''s URL is harvested and retained as evidence for this finding only, and contributes no hotel facts. Both are anti-bot blocked in any case, so Booking scores remain a gap.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-015', 'medium', 'harvest', 'harvest.robots', '2 source(s) publish `Disallow: /` for all agents and were NOT fetched: facebook-azuraworldhotel, facebook-cebecigroup. The ticket lists Facebook as a source; Facebook''s robots.txt refuses it.', 'Respected. Recorded as unavailable rather than empty — ''we were not allowed to look'' and ''we looked and found nothing'' are different claims and only one of them is true here.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-016', 'high', 'branding', 'reviews[].score', 'Neither reseller in the review set publishes its own guest score. OnTheBeach''s 4.6/5 is an embedded Tripadvisor widget carrying the SAME Tripadvisor location id (33144231) as the direct Tripadvisor capture, and the Wyndham-brand page''s 6.7/10 is a Booking.com badge. Filed under the serving host, one number would have appeared as two independent hosts agreeing — which is exactly the input that makes a fact ''confirmed'' under CONTRACTS §1 invariant 3. A single opinion would have been laundered into corroboration, and the laundering would have been invisible.', 'Each score is attributed to the platform that PRODUCED it, not the site that served it, so it can never double-count. A score whose provenance cannot be read off the page is not recorded at all.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-017', 'high', 'branding', 'hotel.name', 'Cebeci Group''s own project index lists FOUR confusable properties: ''Azura World Residence & Hotel'' (Alanya/Türkler), ''Wyndham Hotel Alanya'' (Antalya/Türkler) as a SEPARATE entry in the same district, ''Azura Deluxe Resort and SPA Hotel'' (Alanya/Avsallar) and ''Azura Park Residence'' (Alanya/Mahmutlar). F-007 assumes Azura World Hotel simply IS the rebranded Wyndham Alanya. The developer''s own roster is consistent with that reading but does not establish it, because it shows a separately-named Wyndham hotel in the same district rather than one property under two names.', 'UNRESOLVED, and deliberately so. Every hotel fact in this dataset is sourced to a page naming ''Azura World Hotel'' specifically. No fact is merged across these four properties, and the ex-Wyndham identity is carried as formerName evidence from Agoda/OnTheBeach/Tripadvisor rather than inferred from the developer''s roster.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-018', 'critical', 'branding', 'reviews[].url', 'azuraworldhotel.com — the hotel''s OWN site — links a Tripadvisor review page for ''Azura_Deluxe_Resort_Spa-Avsallar'' (g609052-d7391617), a different Cebeci hotel 60 km away. The correct listing for this property is g1069655-d33144231. Anyone collecting reviews by following the operator''s own link attaches another hotel''s ratings to Azura World, with a citation that resolves perfectly.', 'The review set uses the independently resolved Tripadvisor id, never the operator''s link. The bad link is recorded here because a downstream consumer or a later harvest would otherwise walk into it.', 'null'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-019', 'high', 'pricing', 'units[].askingPrice', '2 Haspo listing(s) inside the ''AZURA WORLD'' complex state a district other than Türkler — one says Oba, one says Mahmutlar while its own headline says Türkler. Azura World Residence & Hotel is in Türkler. The Oba listing is the EUR 112,000 / 80 m² entry price that anchors the bottom of the F-002 range and that SOURCES.md quotes as Haspo''s 1+1 price. If it is a different building, the 2.1x spread in F-002 is partly an artefact of comparing two projects.', 'Both listings are kept, priced as published, and flagged in their unit note. Neither is deleted (that would hide the cheapest evidence) and neither is trusted as an Azura World anchor. This directly weakens F-002''s low end and must be surfaced wherever the price range is shown.', 'null'::jsonb, '[{"value": {"amount": 112000.0, "currency": "EUR", "note": "WRONG-DISTRICT SUSPECT: Azura World is in Türkler, Alanya; the page states district ''Oba'', not Türkler. Emitted unchanged so the builder can decide; do not treat this price as an Azura World anchor without resolving the mismatch (F-002)"}, "source": {"url": "https://hasporealty.com/en/properties/prodaetsya-kvartira-1-1-v-komplekse-azura-world-oba-alanya/", "publisher": "Haspo Realty", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:49:40.807Z", "snapshotHash": "e886d2ae902363209d7f2ad8bfb9f3fcd68760df43504fac2ffa5035f7756293", "tier": 4}}, {"value": {"amount": 178000.0, "currency": "EUR", "note": "WRONG-DISTRICT SUSPECT: Azura World is in Türkler, Alanya; the page states district ''Mahmutlar'', not Türkler (its own headline still says Türkler: ''Apartment 1+1 Azura World, Turkler, Alanya''). Emitted unchanged so the builder can decide; do not treat this price as an Azura World anchor without resolving the mismatch (F-002)"}, "source": {"url": "https://hasporealty.com/en/properties/kvartira-1-1-azura-world-turkler-alanya-2/", "publisher": "Haspo Realty", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:15.913Z", "snapshotHash": "bfb2a415401cc62690628d03c6210af803768715dbe042140b7506cf28b466ef", "tier": 4}}]'::jsonb);
insert into azura_import.finding (id, severity, area, field, message, resolution, resolved_to, competing) values ('F-020', 'medium', 'structure', 'project.developer', 'Sources disagree on project.developer: ''Cebeci Group A.Ş.'' (Alanya-Home); ''Cebeci Group LLC'' (Azura World); ''Cebeci Group'' (Cebeci Group); ''Cebeci Group'' (Azura World); ''Cebeci Group'' (Haspo Realty); ''Cebeci Group'' (Housearch). Discovered by the W0-B harvest; not in SOURCES.md §3.', 'Display value follows tier order (CONTRACTS §1). Every competing value is retained in conflictsWith with its own source and snapshot. Not resolved — no evidence here justifies preferring one publisher''s figure over another''s.', 'null'::jsonb, '[{"value": "Cebeci Group LLC", "source": {"url": "https://www.azuraworld.com/", "publisher": "Azura World", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:46:43.214Z", "snapshotHash": "ca28fe4952729f846a1a080e1fc134ae18d787f2091f8cdc9e42c00ce79f04ab", "tier": 1}}, {"value": "Cebeci Group", "source": {"url": "https://hasporealty.com/en/complex/azura-world/", "publisher": "Haspo Realty", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:28.741Z", "snapshotHash": "4ab2f7b51da8d0d2e037b84259ccfe1f1e43e23589cd3f3137873cf720618e78", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "Cebeci Group", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/de/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:21.849Z", "snapshotHash": "643c8293224695449ccbdd26f25bb41fb8d4fe7154f61e37cabcbd765e01bb1e", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "Cebeci Group", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:47:27.237Z", "snapshotHash": "9d5cd8fe3a54d7795332f47e2e9dde8eb20205b7a50375d4b6ca8046c3865d08", "tier": 4}}, {"value": "Cebeci Group", "source": {"url": "https://housearch.com/ru/turkey/residential-complexes/azura-world-3403639/", "publisher": "Housearch", "fetchedAt": "2026-07-27T14:51:39.282Z", "snapshotHash": "d6bb22